            "review_title": "Review at Loving Hut Thien Quoc vegan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Yuki Doan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nVegan diet once in awhile\nMay 2019 • Friends\nIt was Monday and my friends were on diet so I picked this restaurant as the meeting place for dinner. The menu was very eye-catching and had plenty of dishes. For a vegan place, I'm impressed. The waitresses weren't well-trained, but they were friendly and the service was super quick. Three people but we ate quite a lot. I like their soup, tofu as appetizer and the clay pot rice. The other dishes that we ordered weren't so good, but acceptable. In general, I'm happy with the food and will come back again some other times.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2019",
